      "versionNonce": 923655963,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1778930124101,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "FEATURE MAP / BUILD ORDER:\n1. Scaffold backend + frontend + DB + CRUD/provider clients\n2. Define schemas incl. extraction_runs, reviews, performance_snapshots\n3. OpenAI extraction as phase jobs; persist every input/output\n4. Stream each completed phase into HITL with Supabase Realtime + Inngest\n5. Generate ad groups from validated ideas\n6. Generate creatives: title + description + image/video\n7. Fake deploy + story KPIs; no random metrics\n8. Pioneer only after core loop works",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "FEATURE MAP / BUILD ORDER:\n1. Scaffold backend + frontend + DB + CRUD/provider clients\n2. Define schemas incl. extraction_runs, reviews, performance_snapshots\n3. OpenAI extraction as phase jobs; persist every input/output\n4. Stream each completed phase into HITL with Supabase Realtime + Inngest\n5. Generate ad groups from validated ideas\n6. Generate creatives: title + description + image/video\n7. Fake deploy + story KPIs; no random metrics\n8. Pioneer only after core loop works",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
